WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,160
Make big steamed buns freshly baked

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:02,960
Wang Dagang, why don’t you sting you to death?

3
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,560
Don’t you know the little girl is growing?

4
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:05,800
Give someone a steamed bun to eat

5
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:06,760
Go get something meaty instead.

6
00:00:12,590 --> 00:00:14,230
Isn’t today a working day?

7
00:00:14,230 --> 00:00:15,870
Why is the boss closed for a break?

8
00:00:15,870 --> 00:00:17,470
Yesterday, the boss just finished joining our group

9
00:00:17,470 --> 00:00:19,070
Shareholders are still coming to inspect today.

10
00:00:19,070 --> 00:00:20,230
We didn't even take a break

11
00:00:20,230 --> 00:00:22,750
How can he rest the boss

12
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:23,750
I know you are at home

13
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:24,790
Open the door quickly

14
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:26,540
After we buy coffee, why don't you take a rest?

15
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:27,900
Stop shouting

16
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:32,110
Dad has something to do and has already gone out

17
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:33,230
It's the little boss

18
00:00:33,230 --> 00:00:35,270
How long will it take for your father to come back from his trip?

19
00:00:35,270 --> 00:00:37,040
Don't know

20
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:38,680
Then let's go to work like this today

21
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:40,000
What to do about shareholder inspection

22
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,160
You adults are really
